*

ATOMS
MASS  -1  LP     0.00000 ! EPW
MASS  -1  HW     1.00800 ! H1
MASS  -1  OW    16.00000 ! O

BONDS
! atom types   Kb    b0
HW   HW    553.000   1.3712
HW   OW    553.000   0.8724
LP   OW    553.000   0.1594

ANGLES
! atom types     Ktheta    Theta0
HW   OW   HW     55.000   103.60

DIHEDRALS
! atom types     Kchi    n    delta


IMPROPERS
! atom types     Kpsi    n    delta


NONBONDED nbxmod 5 atom cdiel switch vatom vdistance vswitch -
cutnb 14.0 ctofnb 12.0 ctonnb 10.0 eps 1.0 e14fac 0.8333 wmin 1.5
!type  ignored   epsilon  Rmin/2   ignored   epsilon,1-4    Rmin/2,1-4
HW     0.000000   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
LP     0.000000   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
OW     0.000000  -0.212801   1.777167   0.000000  -0.106400   1.777167

END
